Demo picker fixture notice.

This crate targets the Immich v1.116.2 search contract. That contract comes from upstream commit 8bbcd5c31e4a227f92864ae2977c4033bc0c50b7.
Its response shapes were derived from the upstream OpenAPI spec. That spec carries the AGPL-3.0-only license.
This repository copies no spec text. Tests use hand-made responses that match the old contract.
